    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have a really bad sinus infection and can't breathe through my nose at all. im on haloperidol for my meds so i wanted to check if its okay to take some sudafed (pseudoephedrine) to help clear it up? i just really need some relief so i can sleep",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
